  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup salt",
    "1 cup cold water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 250 degrees F (120 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. Combine flour and salt in a bowl. Add water a few tablespoons at a time, mixing well after each addition, until dough comes together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/31O3LtLRnEllj1vq0LgZ3jk1uFw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240641-salt-dough-DDMFS-step-1-3x4-404402d33ada4b46972fc440b72f50a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240641/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough on a lightly floured surface until smooth, about 10 minutes. Wrap in plastic; rest for 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7nH_rxdXYnasTH1TCHWLc2a9z-I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240641-salt-dough-DDMFS-step-2-2-3x4-2a12a7fd74554322afed691608c104c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240641/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough to a floured work surface; knead until soft and pliable.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wX9zDXdWxENsIA6XBMR-9iPo2XE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240641-salt-dough-DDMFS-step-3-3x4-e084cb2d0c164d8ab3433130a99a9469.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240641/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out dough to ⅛-inch thickness. Cut into desired shapes with festive cookie cutters.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h17FVchV6og-H8JcIbS1QriW2zw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240641-salt-dough-DDMFS-step-4-2-3x4-1354308621554b21b3c3e8374fac6acc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240641/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer ornaments to the prepared baking sheet. Make a small hole in each for hanging using a toothpick or skewer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GpCymyOBUFCZPoKL_AxF53fvLgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240641-salt-dough-DDMFS-step-5-3x4-5d99c56232aa45a58dc75efd017b39d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240641/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until dry and hard, about 2 hours. Cool completely before decorating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
